&lt;li&gt;Added scheduled start gates for update runs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added label-based member selection and configurable failure thresholds for update stages and groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added the &lt;code&gt;SecurityPatch&lt;/code&gt; auto-upgrade channel and additional trigger status details.&lt;/li&gt;
